      "output": "Focus this week on two high\u2011impact tasks that align with your current goals:\n\n1. **Programming exam preparation** \u2013\u202fAllocate the majority of your study time (\u2248\u202f60\u202f% of your weekly hours). Prioritise the topics you\u2019ve struggled with most in past practice tests; do timed coding drills each day to build speed and confidence.\n\n2. **Internship CV draft** \u2013\u202fSpend the remaining time (\u2248\u202f40\u202f%) polishing the CV. Finish the core sections (education, projects, skills) early in the week, then use the weekend to refine language, tailor it to the target internship, and add any measurable results.\n\n**Concrete next steps you can start today**\n\n- Block three 90\u2011minute study sessions for the exam, each focused on a different weak area.  \n- Draft the \u201cProjects\u201d section of your CV (\u2248\u202f200\u202fwords) and set a timer for 45\u202fminutes to keep it concise.  \n\nWould you like a brief outline of the exam topics to target first?",
